Usage: vifstab [flags...] edit [flags...] [operands...]

Edit, validate and save fstab explicitly, using inherited credentials.

Subcommands:
    help  Print this help message
    usage Print this usage message


Flags:
    --file string             (default: "/etc/fstab")   File to edit.
    --backup-dir string       (default: "")             RCS backup directory;
                                                        defaults to the caller's
                                                        cache.
    --systemd-reload string   (default: "warn")         Post-save systemd
                                                        handling: auto, warn or
                                                        never.

Positional Arguments:
    [operands...] No positional operands are accepted.
